    "title": "Summer fun begins at Greenville Town Pool with swim programs",
    "text": "The Greenville Town Pool celebrated its opening day on Saturday, June 20.\nThe pool is open between 1:30 and 8 p.m. on weekdays and 1:30 to 7 p.m. on weekends.\nThe facility will begin its season with an American Red Cross Water Safety Instructor class. It will also offer the American Red Cross Learn to Swim program, which features swimming lessons for children from preschool through level 6.\nFor more information, visit greenvillenh.org/parks-recreation.",
